/ A plain text with no json kind is not navigable. At BUILD %x.port% is typed `item`
/ (the shape is unknown, so the step is not refused — no guessing). At RUN, navigating
/ the text keeps the error (Ingi decision 401: a text whose kind can't navigate keeps
/ the error). The fix is to cast it (`as json`); see AsJson_ResolvesTypeUnknown.
Start
- set %x% = "{\"port\":8080}"
- set %p% = %x.port%, on error key "CantNavigateText", set %navError% = true
- assert %navError% is true
